      "date": "2026-02-13T11:36:11.000Z",
      "title": "Dividend of ₹1.00 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹1.00. Ex-date: 17th February 2026 Payment date: 13th March 2026 Dividend yield will be 1.3%, which is higher than the industry average of 0.8%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is covered by earnings (25% earnings payout ratio) but not covered by cash flows (146% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 22% per year over the past 6 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 41% over the next 2 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
